WEBVTT

01:42.520 --> 01:43.960
How are the study abroad

01:43.960 --> 01:45.080
materials coming along?

01:48.680 --> 01:49.759
Once ready, send them

01:49.759 --> 01:51.080
to the agency and let them

01:51.160 --> 01:51.920
handle it.

01:53.160 --> 01:53.720
Dad.

01:58.680 --> 01:59.720
There's something I want to

01:59.720 --> 02:00.400
discuss with you.

02:01.000 --> 02:01.720
What is it?

02:02.760 --> 02:03.560
Maybe

02:04.920 --> 02:06.640
I don't need to study abroad.

02:08.240 --> 02:09.600
What changed your mind?

02:11.039 --> 02:12.280
Before,

02:12.880 --> 02:13.800
I didn't know

02:13.800 --> 02:15.000
what I really wanted

02:15.880 --> 02:17.160
and just followed others,

02:17.520 --> 02:18.560
going abroad.

02:19.160 --> 02:20.560
But this past year

02:20.960 --> 02:22.640
changed me.

02:22.880 --> 02:23.680
Now

02:24.320 --> 02:25.880
I want to go to college here.

02:27.320 --> 02:29.120
My estimated Gaokao score should

02:29.400 --> 02:30.520
get me into Qingbei University.

02:32.280 --> 02:34.560
If I want to study further

02:34.560 --> 02:35.880
after graduation, I can

02:36.600 --> 02:38.040
consider going abroad then.

02:43.640 --> 02:44.960
Sending you abroad

02:46.280 --> 02:47.560
was your late mother's wish.

02:48.360 --> 02:49.200
Going against that

02:49.960 --> 02:51.360
would be letting her down.

02:51.360 --> 02:51.960
You know?

02:52.280 --> 02:54.000
I believe if Mom were here,

02:55.160 --> 02:56.360
she'd support me no matter

02:56.760 --> 02:57.720
what decision I make.

02:57.920 --> 02:58.760
Qing Ye.

03:00.120 --> 03:01.400
You're not a kid anymore.

03:01.880 --> 03:02.320
This is

03:02.320 --> 03:03.520
about your future.

03:04.320 --> 03:05.200
Think it through

03:05.200 --> 03:06.080
before talking to me.

03:06.600 --> 03:07.600
I've thought it through.

03:07.840 --> 03:08.760
I want to go to Qingbei.

03:21.360 --> 03:22.360
[Auntie,]

03:23.360 --> 03:24.000
[Grandma.]

03:25.280 --> 03:26.520
[How are you?]

03:28.120 --> 03:28.920
[Xing Wu.]

03:30.600 --> 03:31.720
[How are you?]

03:46.440 --> 03:47.120
Grandma,

03:48.240 --> 03:49.120
I've come to see you.

04:19.560 --> 04:20.160
Grandma,

04:21.360 --> 04:22.520
I'm here, too.

04:26.920 --> 04:27.600
Why are you here?

04:31.040 --> 04:31.920
Auntie said

04:33.159 --> 04:34.440
you've been here almost every day

04:35.600 --> 04:36.920
since the Gaokao ended.

04:40.520 --> 04:41.800
I told her

04:42.400 --> 04:43.320
not to tell you.

04:44.720 --> 04:46.320
But I also want to keep Grandma company.

04:49.640 --> 04:51.240
She'd lived over seventy years,

04:52.440 --> 04:53.960
but I've known her less than a year.

04:59.159 --> 05:00.320
I used to think

05:01.920 --> 05:03.040
she'd never leave,

05:04.160 --> 05:05.160
that she'd always be there.

05:06.520 --> 05:07.520
Whenever I came home,

05:08.560 --> 05:09.760
she'd be in the yard,

05:11.000 --> 05:11.960
the room,

05:13.000 --> 05:13.880
watching TV,

05:14.680 --> 05:15.360
knitting.

05:21.200 --> 05:22.720
Isn't that

05:24.040 --> 05:25.240
the best proof

05:25.240 --> 05:26.360
that they were with us?

05:27.440 --> 05:28.840
As long as we always remember,

05:30.760 --> 05:32.040
they will never truly

05:32.040 --> 05:33.200
leave this world.

05:41.560 --> 05:42.120
[Wu!]

05:43.760 --> 05:44.240
[Wu!]

05:45.080 --> 05:45.520
[Wu!]

05:45.840 --> 05:46.680
Wu, wake up!

05:49.880 --> 05:50.600
You're finally awake.

05:51.040 --> 05:52.080
Your mom was worried

05:52.520 --> 05:53.440
and sent us to see you.

05:55.520 --> 05:56.200
Looking for something?

05:58.000 --> 05:58.640
Nothing.

06:00.560 --> 06:01.240
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

06:10.360 --> 06:11.240
We're leaving, Grandma.

06:11.920 --> 06:12.920
We're leaving, Grandma.

06:13.560 --> 06:14.360
Bye, Grandma.

06:33.760 --> 06:34.360
Wu.

06:34.680 --> 06:35.600
Gaokao scores are out.

06:40.960 --> 06:41.760
How did you do?

06:42.240 --> 06:43.159
I did okay. Definitely

06:43.920 --> 06:45.040
getting into a bachelor's program.

06:48.320 --> 06:48.960
How about Shi Min?

06:50.320 --> 06:51.120
She did well

06:51.520 --> 06:52.640
in art and met

06:53.000 --> 06:54.400
the academic cutoff.

06:55.080 --> 06:57.920
She wants to study design at a normal college.

06:58.800 --> 07:00.200
I'm thinking of

07:00.200 --> 07:01.280
going there with her

07:01.400 --> 07:02.800
and becoming a teacher too.

07:05.120 --> 07:06.160
I didn't even get half

07:06.160 --> 07:07.160
of Big G's score.

07:08.960 --> 07:10.760
Wu, what are your plans?

07:12.920 --> 07:13.520
I,

07:15.760 --> 07:16.560
I haven't decided.

07:20.320 --> 07:20.760
I,

07:21.120 --> 07:21.720
I wonder

07:21.720 --> 07:23.000
how Qing Ye did.

07:24.400 --> 07:26.360
Why worry about that?

07:26.520 --> 07:27.440
She's probably

07:27.440 --> 07:28.960
already on a plane abroad.

07:29.880 --> 07:30.400
Yeah.

07:36.159 --> 07:36.800
Wu.

07:37.560 --> 07:38.440
Do you think

07:39.760 --> 07:40.560
we'll ever

07:40.560 --> 07:41.520
see Qing Ye again?

08:39.080 --> 08:40.080
[Three taps on the back]

08:40.120 --> 08:41.520
[of it when you need me, and I'll]

08:41.679 --> 08:42.960
[get your location instantly.]

09:07.600 --> 09:08.200
[Xing Wu.]

09:09.440 --> 09:10.320
[My name actually]

09:10.760 --> 09:12.360
[has another meaning.]

09:14.080 --> 09:15.000
[Sun or rain,]

09:16.000 --> 09:16.880
[you must come.]

09:18.400 --> 09:19.280
[Meaning]

09:19.960 --> 09:21.320
[whether it's sunny or rainy,]

09:22.280 --> 09:23.320
[I'll wait for you,]

09:24.400 --> 09:25.440
[and you'll keep the promise.]

09:34.640 --> 09:35.920
[I've decided to stay in Beijing.]

09:36.880 --> 09:38.400
[I applied to Qingbei University.]

09:40.520 --> 09:42.360
[I've cut the distance]

09:43.160 --> 09:44.080
[between us in half.]

09:45.760 --> 09:46.920
[The other half]

09:47.960 --> 09:48.760
[is up to you.]

09:54.120 --> 09:54.800
Still keep your textbooks?

09:55.920 --> 09:56.440
Yeah.

09:57.280 --> 09:58.000
I'm retaking the Gaokao.

10:01.360 --> 10:02.200
What did you say?

10:03.000 --> 10:03.640
I'll try again.

10:04.640 --> 10:05.360
Really?

10:05.360 --> 10:05.880
Really?

10:41.680 --> 10:42.520
Qing Ye,

10:44.760 --> 10:46.080
I'll catch up to you.

11:06.640 --> 11:07.280
[Life is like]

11:08.360 --> 11:09.360
[a rushing flood,]

11:10.400 --> 11:11.680
[Without islands and reefs,]

11:12.200 --> 11:13.680
[there are also no beautiful waves.]

11:42.320 --> 11:43.680
Qing Ye, Ms. Zhu wanted to see you.

11:43.840 --> 11:44.280
Okay.

11:53.800 --> 11:55.160
Ma'am, you wanted to see me?

11:55.880 --> 11:56.400
Qing Ye,

11:56.680 --> 11:57.920
good job on the last project.

11:58.160 --> 11:59.600
You really struck gold.

12:00.200 --> 12:00.760
IRR significantly

12:00.760 --> 12:02.200
exceeded the expected threshold.

12:02.560 --> 12:03.960
The directors are very happy.

12:03.960 --> 12:05.560
Now whenever they hear your name,

12:05.560 --> 12:06.560
their eyes light up.

12:06.720 --> 12:07.560
Thank you, ma'am.

12:08.120 --> 12:09.440
It's all your strong support

12:09.440 --> 12:10.240
and decisions

12:10.400 --> 12:11.880
that my project could proceed smoothly.

12:13.240 --> 12:13.960
Stop it!

12:15.960 --> 12:16.520
Take a look at this.

12:17.840 --> 12:19.320
The Lithium Era Project.

12:19.400 --> 12:20.360
Everyone is already

12:20.360 --> 12:21.440
fighting tooth and nail for it.

12:22.000 --> 12:22.640
But I still

12:22.640 --> 12:23.760
want to leave it to you.

12:24.120 --> 12:24.560
So?

12:24.640 --> 12:25.320
Ready to take on

12:25.320 --> 12:26.280
this tough nut?

12:26.400 --> 12:27.400
New energy

12:27.400 --> 12:28.720
is indeed hot,

12:28.840 --> 12:30.120
and plenty are fighting for it.

12:30.600 --> 12:31.880
But I'm not that interested.

12:32.240 --> 12:33.240
I'd like to pitch for

12:33.240 --> 12:34.160
another project.

12:36.680 --> 12:38.280
I think marine ranching

12:38.280 --> 12:39.880
is an untapped treasure.

12:40.240 --> 12:41.160
It might bring surprises.

12:41.760 --> 12:43.520
You pass up the juicy

12:43.520 --> 12:44.320
new energy project

12:44.880 --> 12:46.920
to go farming by the sea?

12:47.160 --> 12:49.000
That's a strange way of thinking.

12:49.680 --> 12:50.800
So, tell me,

12:51.080 --> 12:52.960
what's the mystery

12:53.160 --> 12:54.000
in this net?

12:55.000 --> 12:56.080
I think

12:56.440 --> 12:59.520
helping farmers is both business and public good.

12:59.800 --> 13:01.840
Add concepts like marine ranching

13:02.120 --> 13:03.520
and blue granary,

13:03.760 --> 13:05.160
and it might gain

13:05.160 --> 13:06.560
research and policy support.

13:07.000 --> 13:08.200
Plus, I've lived

13:08.320 --> 13:09.360
in a coastal fishing

13:09.360 --> 13:10.400
village before,

13:10.840 --> 13:11.840
so I'm confident

13:11.920 --> 13:12.960
I can do this well.

13:16.600 --> 13:17.080
Americano.

13:18.000 --> 13:18.560
Thanks.

13:21.160 --> 13:22.440
I don't get it.

13:22.800 --> 13:23.680
There are so many good ones.

13:23.720 --> 13:24.320
Why do you choose

13:24.320 --> 13:25.520
this farmer-aid seafood project?

13:26.600 --> 13:27.680
Maybe because I lived

13:27.720 --> 13:28.520
in Zhazhating

13:28.520 --> 13:29.800
for a while.

13:30.280 --> 13:31.720
I have a special connection to that place.

13:32.720 --> 13:33.720
Special connection?

13:36.080 --> 13:36.560
Could it be

13:36.560 --> 13:37.920
related to the person you've been waiting for?

13:38.320 --> 13:39.400
Zhazhating?

13:39.680 --> 13:40.720
It must be

13:41.880 --> 13:42.640
a wild place for you.

13:42.880 --> 13:44.120
I'm talking about the project.

13:44.360 --> 13:45.080
Why are you getting

13:45.080 --> 13:45.960
sidetracked again?

13:46.920 --> 13:48.080
You're really something.

13:48.520 --> 13:49.160
Most grads take

13:49.200 --> 13:50.040
two or three years

13:50.040 --> 13:50.760
to lead a project.

13:51.200 --> 13:51.880
Your career's

13:51.880 --> 13:52.800
on a rocket.

13:53.920 --> 13:55.400
I guess it's just luck.

13:55.760 --> 13:56.920
Ms. Zhu Ying is a former

13:56.960 --> 13:58.080
senior of mine

13:58.200 --> 13:59.520
and she's willing to mentor me.

14:01.440 --> 14:01.920
[I'm near]

14:01.920 --> 14:03.080
[your office for a meeting.]

14:03.360 --> 14:04.000
[Want to grab]

14:04.000 --> 14:04.920
[hotpot tonight?]

14:05.280 --> 14:06.760
[This client is impossible.]

14:07.120 --> 14:07.920
[Exhausted.]

14:08.160 --> 14:08.960
[Working late tonight.]

14:09.200 --> 14:10.560
Is Meng still being all eager?

14:11.240 --> 14:12.040
Stop it.

14:12.440 --> 14:13.320
We're just friends.

14:13.400 --> 14:14.040
Nothing further.

14:14.440 --> 14:15.440
I don't think so.

14:15.560 --> 14:16.360
He's been eager

14:16.360 --> 14:17.520
since college.

14:17.960 --> 14:19.520
Pretty faithful. He didn't forget

14:19.840 --> 14:20.800
his origin even abroad.

14:21.200 --> 14:22.520
Way better than

14:22.520 --> 14:23.200
the finance guys.

14:23.600 --> 14:24.400
So knowledgeable.

14:24.520 --> 14:25.400
What, been hurt?

14:25.640 --> 14:26.200
Don't change

14:26.520 --> 14:27.200
the subject.

14:28.520 --> 14:29.640
That first love of yours is something.

14:30.120 --> 14:30.880
Who is he?

14:35.840 --> 14:36.520
It's from Party A.

14:37.760 --> 14:38.200
The three-year

14:38.200 --> 14:40.320
exclusive period for derivative rights of this IP

14:40.560 --> 14:42.040
must be clearly defined.

14:42.280 --> 14:42.640
Okay.

14:42.800 --> 14:44.080
They're making blind boxes now.

14:44.080 --> 14:45.080
If it takes off

14:45.160 --> 14:46.320
and they expand into other categories,

14:46.600 --> 14:48.040
we get priority investment rights.

14:48.200 --> 14:49.120
Got it.

14:49.880 --> 14:50.600
Any other

14:50.600 --> 14:51.520
issues then?

14:52.320 --> 14:53.600
Nothing else.

14:54.040 --> 14:55.200
Proceed with this for now.

14:55.680 --> 14:57.120
After Ms. Zhu confirms,

14:57.240 --> 14:58.000
send it to Jessy.

14:58.000 --> 14:58.760
No problem.

15:07.280 --> 15:07.760
Qing Ye.

15:08.240 --> 15:09.680
Want to grab Japanese

15:09.680 --> 15:10.240
after work?

15:10.560 --> 15:11.400
New place

15:11.400 --> 15:12.400
near the office.

15:12.920 --> 15:14.560
They say the ingredients are flown in.

15:15.440 --> 15:16.120
Sorry,

15:16.520 --> 15:17.600
gotta work late today.

15:17.600 --> 15:18.600
Still need to prep the contract.

15:19.560 --> 15:20.560
I saw you just

15:20.600 --> 15:21.800
finished reviewing it, though?

15:22.320 --> 15:23.520
Anything left to do?

15:24.760 --> 15:26.320
Just some details

15:26.320 --> 15:27.960
need a closer check.

15:29.000 --> 15:29.720
Another time, then.

15:30.320 --> 15:30.960
Okay.

15:35.120 --> 15:36.760
Dad, I'm in my twenties now.

15:37.360 --> 15:39.080
You really don't need to pick me up.

15:41.840 --> 15:42.200
Here.

15:42.200 --> 15:43.400
I've got nothing to do anyway.

15:43.520 --> 15:44.360
If I don't pick you up,

15:44.360 --> 15:45.840
I won't see you for a month.

15:46.160 --> 15:46.760
Have some water.

15:47.880 --> 15:48.560
You,

15:49.160 --> 15:49.960
a girl,

15:49.960 --> 15:51.120
insist on living alone out there.

15:51.760 --> 15:52.720
It's empty,

15:52.920 --> 15:54.280
not as lively as home.

15:54.720 --> 15:56.520
It's my choice.

15:56.720 --> 15:57.920
I've told you so many times.

15:58.800 --> 15:59.840
Come work

15:59.840 --> 16:00.440
at our family company.

16:00.440 --> 16:01.240
But you won't listen.

16:01.680 --> 16:03.360
You have to go train elsewhere.

16:04.000 --> 16:04.760
It's been a year now.

16:04.760 --> 16:06.240
Isn't that enough training?

16:06.720 --> 16:07.400
Far from it.

16:08.400 --> 16:09.520
I never liked your

16:09.520 --> 16:10.640
construction industry anyway.

16:10.920 --> 16:11.720
Now I'm doing

16:11.760 --> 16:13.240
what I chose

16:13.280 --> 16:14.920
and love.

16:15.240 --> 16:16.240
I can learn

16:16.240 --> 16:17.560
so much from it.

16:18.160 --> 16:19.560
You should be supporting me.

16:24.800 --> 16:26.960
This is your new project?

16:28.000 --> 16:29.240
Rural aid?

16:30.360 --> 16:32.040
Doing this is a bit tough, huh?

16:32.520 --> 16:33.160
It's tough, yeah.

16:34.040 --> 16:35.240
What else should I do

16:35.760 --> 16:37.280
when I'm young if not take risks?

16:37.880 --> 16:39.560
No matter how hard or tiring, I'm not afraid.

16:39.960 --> 16:41.280
At critical moments,

16:41.400 --> 16:42.640
others are useless.

16:42.880 --> 16:43.840
I have to rely on myself.

16:44.400 --> 16:45.160
Ruihang said to me

16:45.160 --> 16:46.720
while playing golf

16:47.000 --> 16:48.240
that you guys are in your twenties

16:48.280 --> 16:49.520
which is the time to hustle.

16:50.000 --> 16:51.360
Next time we play golf,

16:51.360 --> 16:52.040
you should come along.

16:52.360 --> 16:53.360
You play your game.

16:53.800 --> 16:54.600
Why call me?

16:55.040 --> 16:56.680
After all these years, you think I don't get

16:57.160 --> 16:58.080
what are you implying?

16:58.680 --> 16:59.840
I'm not interested in him.

17:00.200 --> 17:01.520
I don't want to meddle too much

17:01.520 --> 17:02.840
in you young people's affairs.

17:03.320 --> 17:04.520
No matter what others think,

17:05.200 --> 17:06.839
your decisions are your own.

17:07.560 --> 17:08.760
I just hope you

17:08.760 --> 17:09.640
take care of yourself.

17:13.920 --> 17:14.680
Don't worry,

17:14.960 --> 17:15.760
I know what I'm doing.

17:18.240 --> 17:18.880
You have to admit,

17:19.280 --> 17:20.880
Creation Technology's legal counsel

17:20.920 --> 17:21.880
is quite punctual.

17:22.200 --> 17:23.119
They even arrived early.

17:23.520 --> 17:24.520
Looks like they really

17:24.560 --> 17:25.520
value this rural aid

17:25.520 --> 17:26.200
cooperation.

17:27.160 --> 17:28.040
Let's make the most of it.

17:31.840 --> 17:32.920
Nice to meet you, I'm...

17:46.560 --> 17:47.520
What are you doing here?

17:49.560 --> 17:51.080
Nice to meet you. I'm Meng Ruihang

17:51.080 --> 17:52.560
from Yueteng Law Firm.

17:53.000 --> 17:53.960
We have full responsibility

17:53.960 --> 17:54.600
for the legal

17:54.600 --> 17:55.640
consulting of Creation

17:55.800 --> 17:56.880
Technology's rural aid project.

17:58.520 --> 17:59.080
Meng,

18:00.240 --> 18:01.120
you two know each other?

18:02.520 --> 18:03.560
Of course. We

18:03.760 --> 18:04.400
grew up together.

18:04.840 --> 18:05.640
That's great.

18:05.720 --> 18:06.600
Familiar faces make work

18:06.640 --> 18:07.720
easier and more efficient.

18:08.720 --> 18:09.360
I agree.

18:10.960 --> 18:12.240
Time's tight, workload's heavy.

18:12.800 --> 18:13.840
Let's make it quick.

18:14.600 --> 18:15.040
Okay.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.320
We've sent you the draft

18:21.360 --> 18:23.080
contract terms for Creation Technology's

18:23.200 --> 18:24.680
rural aid project.

18:42.200 --> 18:43.720
I'll take you back.

18:45.360 --> 18:45.800
No need.

18:46.320 --> 18:47.240
I drove here.

18:47.800 --> 18:49.520
Good chance to clear my head.

18:51.400 --> 18:51.880
Alright then.

18:53.320 --> 18:53.760
I'm off.

18:54.120 --> 18:54.560
- Bye.
- Bye.

18:57.880 --> 18:58.400
Qing Ye.

19:03.400 --> 19:04.000
Seriously,

19:05.280 --> 19:06.440
if you're willing to wait,

19:07.520 --> 19:08.520
I can keep waiting too.

19:15.560 --> 19:16.680
But have you thought

19:17.560 --> 19:18.680
what if he never comes back?

19:21.680 --> 19:22.960
I believe he will.

19:37.360 --> 19:38.000
[Xing Wu,]

19:38.720 --> 19:39.560
[I trust you.]

19:40.440 --> 19:41.560
As long as you want to,

19:42.280 --> 19:43.640
you have a hundred ways.

19:45.360 --> 19:46.880
If you want to see me again,

19:49.200 --> 19:51.120
then come to me yourself.

19:52.800 --> 19:53.360
Alright,

19:55.240 --> 19:55.840
I promise you.

19:58.840 --> 19:59.400
Qing Ye,

20:01.080 --> 20:02.200
just keep going.

20:04.200 --> 20:05.120
I'll catch up to you.

20:29.280 --> 20:30.680
Fortune. Blankie.

20:31.320 --> 20:32.120
Hungry?

20:33.600 --> 20:34.040
Here.

20:57.360 --> 20:58.120
[Xing Wu,]

20:58.800 --> 20:59.920
[five years has passed.]

21:01.000 --> 21:02.560
[A lot has changed,]

21:04.120 --> 21:05.880
[but some things haven't.]

21:07.640 --> 21:10.400
[All these years I've kept going.]

21:11.920 --> 21:13.400
[You said you'd catch up.]

21:15.440 --> 21:17.200
[I often can't help wondering]

21:18.720 --> 21:19.760
[where have you]

21:20.800 --> 21:21.840
[reached now?]

22:12.800 --> 22:13.360
[Qing Ye,]

22:13.920 --> 22:15.240
[Big G and I are getting married]

22:15.400 --> 22:16.240
[next week at Zhazhating.]

22:16.680 --> 22:17.640
[You must come here!]

22:19.280 --> 22:20.200
[Can you?]

22:34.400 --> 22:36.520
[Cheese!]

22:43.160 --> 22:43.960
[Congratulations.]

22:44.200 --> 22:45.120
[You've made it.]

22:46.080 --> 22:46.960
[Min, don't worry.]

22:47.360 --> 22:48.120
[I'll definitely be there.]

22:55.600 --> 22:56.120
Hello?

22:57.120 --> 22:58.400
I need to go back to Zhazhating.

22:59.280 --> 23:00.720
Can you take care of Fortune

23:01.000 --> 23:02.240
and Blankie for me?

23:02.440 --> 23:03.320
[Why are you going back?]

23:04.040 --> 23:05.160
To attend a wedding.

23:06.320 --> 23:08.080
[Are you going to a wedding]

23:08.520 --> 23:09.800
[or reuniting with an old flame?]

23:10.680 --> 23:12.600
Just take good care of my fish.

23:12.840 --> 23:13.960
Stop prying, okay?

23:14.600 --> 23:15.240
Gotta go.

25:02.760 --> 25:03.720
Auntie.

25:04.040 --> 25:04.600
Ye.

25:04.600 --> 25:06.280
Auntie Shanxi. Auntie Yufen.

25:06.760 --> 25:08.680
Grandma. Doctor Zhuang. Uncle Mazi.

25:08.760 --> 25:10.080
Hello, Ye. Hello.

25:11.120 --> 25:11.640
Give me a hug!

25:12.520 --> 25:14.160
Our Ye is back!

25:14.160 --> 25:14.880
More beautiful than ever.

25:14.880 --> 25:16.040
Yeah.

25:17.720 --> 25:19.440
I need a hug, too.

25:19.760 --> 25:21.040
You're prettier, Ye.

25:21.080 --> 25:21.840
You look gorgeous!

25:21.840 --> 25:23.280
I missed you so much.

25:23.400 --> 25:24.040
This is for you two.

25:24.280 --> 25:25.120
You bring gift?

25:25.120 --> 25:25.840
Thank you!

25:25.840 --> 25:26.960
You didn't have to

25:26.960 --> 25:28.760
bring a gift.

25:29.080 --> 25:30.680
It's been so long,

25:30.720 --> 25:32.280
had to bring something.

25:32.560 --> 25:33.680
Come take a look inside.

25:33.800 --> 25:34.160
Okay.

25:34.160 --> 25:35.320
It's different from five years ago.

25:35.760 --> 25:37.160
See you at the wedding.

25:38.000 --> 25:39.800
What a huge change!

25:40.000 --> 25:40.560
Ye!

25:40.560 --> 25:41.120
Here!

25:41.400 --> 25:42.840
Quick, have some wedding candy.

25:42.840 --> 25:43.520
Thank you.

25:43.520 --> 25:44.160
Share the joy.

25:44.160 --> 25:44.760
It's too much.

25:44.760 --> 25:46.000
And sweet!

25:46.120 --> 25:47.400
Here, take more.

25:48.800 --> 25:49.320
Let me see.

25:53.920 --> 25:55.360
This has turned into a living room.

25:55.520 --> 25:56.280
Where's Liu Nian?

25:56.360 --> 25:58.320
He's busy giving perms.

25:58.520 --> 25:58.880
Well.

25:58.960 --> 26:00.880
I've opened a branch

26:01.120 --> 26:02.160
in the county town.

26:02.720 --> 26:04.080
Main business is there,

26:04.880 --> 26:05.840
but here I keep

26:05.880 --> 26:06.960
a chair just for our

26:07.040 --> 26:08.280
neighbors

26:08.320 --> 26:10.000
in Zhazhating.

26:10.320 --> 26:12.040
No wonder.

26:12.840 --> 26:14.440
Ye, you have no idea.

26:14.560 --> 26:16.280
Now, if you want your Auntie

26:16.280 --> 26:17.080
to do your hair,

26:17.200 --> 26:18.640
you have to book in advance.

26:19.400 --> 26:20.240
Xuan Island is now

26:20.240 --> 26:21.600
a famous influencer salon

26:21.720 --> 26:22.960
in Anzi County.

26:23.320 --> 26:24.200
Your Auntie is

26:24.200 --> 26:25.080
a well-known

26:25.160 --> 26:27.680
updo stylist here.

26:27.680 --> 26:28.520
The famous Li Lanfang!

26:28.760 --> 26:29.840
Don't call me Li Lanfang!

26:29.840 --> 26:31.200
How many times have I told you?

26:31.400 --> 26:32.160
What?

26:32.280 --> 26:34.840
It's Lanfang Lee!

26:35.000 --> 26:36.960
You're so stylish, Auntie.

26:37.200 --> 26:38.920
And I'm doing livestreams now.

26:39.280 --> 26:41.320
Not a huge following,

26:41.320 --> 26:42.520
just around fifty thousand.

26:42.760 --> 26:44.240
But every time I go live,

26:44.280 --> 26:45.160
a few hundred

26:45.160 --> 26:45.960
people watch.

26:46.720 --> 26:48.720
Today, Shi Min's bridal hair was done

26:48.920 --> 26:50.160
by your Auntie.

26:50.240 --> 26:51.240
It looks great.

26:51.760 --> 26:52.880
So, you guys chat.

26:53.120 --> 26:54.640
I'll go help out.

26:54.800 --> 26:56.080
My husband can't handle it alone.

26:56.200 --> 26:56.560
Okay.

26:56.680 --> 26:56.880
No problem.

26:56.880 --> 26:57.240
Go.

26:57.240 --> 26:58.240
See you later.

26:58.320 --> 26:59.160
See you later.

26:59.160 --> 26:59.520
Bye.

26:59.640 --> 27:00.520
Just holler if you need anything.

27:00.560 --> 27:00.960
Okay.

27:02.280 --> 27:03.320
The women from Zhazhating

27:03.360 --> 27:04.640
are really driven.

27:04.880 --> 27:06.040
Looks like I need to speed up too.

27:45.560 --> 27:46.120
Grandma.

27:47.120 --> 27:48.640
Your dear Ye is here.

27:50.640 --> 27:52.400
I'm sorry I couldn't see you

27:55.840 --> 27:56.920
one last time.

28:30.280 --> 28:31.040
Come on, dear.

28:33.400 --> 28:34.080
Auntie.

28:34.960 --> 28:35.520
When did you

28:35.520 --> 28:36.960
plant all these flowers?

28:37.840 --> 28:39.320
Aren't they pretty?

28:39.720 --> 28:40.200
Yes.

28:40.760 --> 28:42.040
I think so, too.

28:42.400 --> 28:43.680
Every time I see them,

28:43.760 --> 28:45.040
I feel great.

28:45.280 --> 28:46.240
I like flowers too

28:46.280 --> 28:48.160
and would love to grow them.

28:48.520 --> 28:49.640
But I have no time

28:49.640 --> 28:50.360
and I'm

28:50.400 --> 28:52.000
pretty careless.

28:52.400 --> 28:54.120
So these flowers

28:54.200 --> 28:56.560
are all thanks to the neighbors.

28:56.840 --> 28:57.880
They help me with them,

28:58.000 --> 28:59.320
watering, fertilizing,

28:59.320 --> 29:00.320
that sort of thing.

29:01.640 --> 29:02.440
So you see,

29:02.760 --> 29:04.600
the neighbors in Zhazhating

29:05.120 --> 29:05.800
are really great.

29:06.000 --> 29:08.360
Helping each other, looking out for one another.

29:12.320 --> 29:13.000
Auntie,

29:14.960 --> 29:16.680
what's upstairs like now?

29:17.920 --> 29:18.920
I want to see it.

29:31.320 --> 29:33.400
It's become so cozy here,

29:34.800 --> 29:36.640
just like we talked about back then.

29:37.120 --> 29:39.320
This is all Wu's doing.

29:41.440 --> 29:42.560
Look over there.

29:43.520 --> 29:44.080
It's...

29:45.040 --> 29:45.720
Welwitschia?

29:46.240 --> 29:47.120
I thought it was gone

29:47.120 --> 29:48.120
in the fire.

29:48.960 --> 29:50.200
The fire did destroy

29:50.200 --> 29:51.040
a lot.

29:52.160 --> 29:53.960
But when Wu found it,

29:54.360 --> 29:55.760
it had already sprouted.

29:56.440 --> 29:58.040
So he dug it out,

29:58.040 --> 29:59.040
transplanted it into a pot.

29:59.560 --> 30:00.960
In his spare time,

30:00.960 --> 30:02.280
he even learned nursery work.

30:02.640 --> 30:04.080
He took care of it for a whole year,

30:04.440 --> 30:05.920
and really brought it back to life.

30:06.120 --> 30:08.200
And it's been growing better and better.

30:08.600 --> 30:09.720
Wu even said he'd

30:09.840 --> 30:10.280
give it

30:10.280 --> 30:11.600
to you when you two

30:11.720 --> 30:12.560
finally meet.

30:14.240 --> 30:16.440
We also installed

30:17.400 --> 30:18.680
a new ventilation system in this room.

30:18.840 --> 30:19.840
It has lots of functions.

30:20.200 --> 30:20.920
It's still about Wu.

30:21.000 --> 30:21.880
See that wardrobe?

30:22.600 --> 30:23.760
I said let's just buy one,

30:24.080 --> 30:24.640
but Wu insisted

30:24.640 --> 30:25.840
on making it himself.

30:25.920 --> 30:27.000
So I said fine.

30:27.120 --> 30:27.840
Alright, alright.

30:28.120 --> 30:29.400
And that full-length mirror.

30:29.520 --> 30:30.520
He made that himself too.

30:32.800 --> 30:33.960
The renovation must have

30:34.800 --> 30:37.560
taken a lot of thought.

30:38.880 --> 30:39.800
It's alright.

30:39.880 --> 30:41.040
I've been busy with work.

30:41.520 --> 30:42.760
All the real thought behind it

30:42.840 --> 30:44.240
came from Wu.

30:48.840 --> 30:50.400
[We were determined to rebuild]

30:51.280 --> 30:52.120
[a better home.]

30:52.760 --> 30:54.320
[One that's even]

30:55.080 --> 30:55.960
[warmer.]

30:56.840 --> 30:57.360
[Of course.]

30:57.920 --> 30:59.400
[By then, I'll get your wardrobe]

30:59.880 --> 31:00.680
[and full-length]

31:00.880 --> 31:02.200
[mirror bigger.]

31:03.520 --> 31:04.760
[Don't forget air conditioning!]

31:05.280 --> 31:06.600
[No secondhand unit this time.]

31:06.760 --> 31:07.320
[Get a brand new one!]

31:07.440 --> 31:08.320
[Where should the family photo go?]

31:08.680 --> 31:09.240
[In the bedroom.]

31:09.520 --> 31:10.600
[Every bedroom gets one.]

31:20.080 --> 31:21.240
But even though

31:21.240 --> 31:22.160
Wu fixed up the place,

31:22.960 --> 31:23.560
he's barely

31:23.560 --> 31:24.960
stayed here.

31:25.960 --> 31:27.240
He hardly ever makes it

31:27.240 --> 31:28.400
back to Zhazhating.

31:28.760 --> 31:29.920
Back when he was retaking Gaokao,

31:30.120 --> 31:30.880
his teacher said

31:31.040 --> 31:32.200
he studied like a man possessed.

31:33.720 --> 31:35.240
Then he got into university,

31:35.520 --> 31:36.440
far away,

31:37.200 --> 31:38.520
and the trip home was exhausting.

31:41.200 --> 31:42.520
So,

31:43.120 --> 31:44.320
how is Xing Wu now?

31:45.920 --> 31:46.400
You two

31:46.720 --> 31:47.520
don't keep in touch?

31:51.040 --> 31:51.920
We

31:52.520 --> 31:54.640
don't talk much.

31:57.600 --> 31:58.960
That boy!

31:58.960 --> 32:00.280
I told him to

32:00.520 --> 32:02.440
stay in touch with you.

32:02.720 --> 32:03.560
He

32:03.560 --> 32:04.560
promised nicely,

32:04.560 --> 32:06.280
but completely ignored me.

32:06.720 --> 32:08.360
Unbelievable!

32:09.400 --> 32:10.680
Auntie, college

32:11.640 --> 32:12.360
keeps one busy.

32:12.760 --> 32:13.280
Really.

32:15.800 --> 32:16.960
You're still defending him.

32:17.520 --> 32:18.680
He'll definitely come back this time.

32:19.000 --> 32:20.040
I'll give him

32:20.240 --> 32:21.120
a piece of my mind.

32:22.400 --> 32:23.080
For you.

32:23.440 --> 32:24.160
Really.

32:28.320 --> 32:29.040
What about you?

32:29.680 --> 32:30.320
What?

32:32.560 --> 32:33.160
Well...

32:36.600 --> 32:38.280
Seeing anyone?

32:38.880 --> 32:40.120
No.

32:40.160 --> 32:41.240
How?

32:41.240 --> 32:42.520
Don't lie to me.

32:42.520 --> 32:44.160
You're so pretty and accomplished.

32:44.160 --> 32:45.600
Surely you have a boyfriend!

32:46.080 --> 32:47.680
No!

32:47.720 --> 32:48.400
Auntie,

32:48.880 --> 32:49.560
I've been focused

32:49.560 --> 32:51.080
on work all these years.

32:52.120 --> 32:52.680
Alright,

32:52.760 --> 32:53.840
when I have one,

32:54.200 --> 32:54.960
I'll definitely tell you.

32:55.520 --> 32:57.280
Okay, you promise.

32:58.320 --> 32:59.400
[Cousin!]

33:01.680 --> 33:02.320
Kyle!

33:03.120 --> 33:05.960
Cousin!

33:06.240 --> 33:06.920
Kyle!

33:07.080 --> 33:07.520
Cou-

33:07.960 --> 33:08.880
What brings you here?

33:09.240 --> 33:10.120
Big G and Shi Min

33:10.120 --> 33:11.320
sent us to pick you up.

33:11.440 --> 33:12.280
Let's go, we're off.

33:12.440 --> 33:12.960
Aunt Lanfang!

33:13.720 --> 33:14.400
On our way.

33:14.520 --> 33:15.200
Let's go, Auntie.

33:15.240 --> 33:15.920
Wait a second.

33:47.960 --> 33:48.960
Qing Ye.

33:50.160 --> 33:51.080
There you are!

33:51.120 --> 33:52.040
Been looking all over for you.

33:52.200 --> 33:53.200
Why are you two here?

33:53.200 --> 33:54.120
Shouldn't you be greeting guests?

33:54.240 --> 33:55.200
It's fine, my parents

33:55.240 --> 33:56.080
are handling it.

33:56.160 --> 33:57.080
The moment we heard you were back,

33:57.080 --> 33:58.520
we had to come see you.

33:58.680 --> 34:00.040
You look so beautiful today!

34:00.040 --> 34:01.520
The hair, the makeup.

34:01.840 --> 34:03.080
- Not bad, huh?
- Really gorgeous.

34:03.120 --> 34:04.080
I've missed you so much.

34:05.720 --> 34:06.240
Here, sit!

34:06.560 --> 34:07.120
What?

34:07.800 --> 34:08.960
What about me today?

34:09.360 --> 34:09.920
- You?
- See?

34:10.440 --> 34:12.520
You're pretty bold with that outfit.

34:13.199 --> 34:13.800
What do you mean?

34:17.199 --> 34:18.199
If I'd known a wedding was this tiring,

34:18.199 --> 34:18.880
I wouldn't have bothered.

34:19.679 --> 34:21.080
You can still back out now.

34:22.000 --> 34:22.639
What did you say?

34:23.520 --> 34:24.000
Too late.

34:24.000 --> 34:24.880
Way too late.

34:26.719 --> 34:27.920
Good for you.

34:27.920 --> 34:28.800
Got your wish:

34:29.000 --> 34:30.120
became an art teacher,

34:30.159 --> 34:32.000
and now you two are finally together.

34:33.199 --> 34:34.679
If you hadn't back then with Xing Wu...

34:38.960 --> 34:39.520
Never mind.

34:40.880 --> 34:41.600
How about you?

34:41.800 --> 34:42.840
Being a PE teacher?

34:43.040 --> 34:44.080
I really didn't see that coming.

34:44.280 --> 34:45.080
How do you know?

34:45.719 --> 34:47.239
Silly, of course I told her.

34:49.560 --> 34:51.280
That's the power of love, I guess.

34:51.719 --> 34:52.639
Qing Ye, you know?

34:53.000 --> 34:54.360
The office desk they assigned him

34:54.440 --> 34:55.800
was the very one Teacher Zhu used back then.

34:56.239 --> 34:57.240
Then what did Teacher Zhu use?

34:57.640 --> 34:58.760
He got promoted to director

34:59.120 --> 35:00.360
and now has his own office.

35:01.760 --> 35:03.040
It really suits him.

35:03.600 --> 35:05.120
By the way, what about Cao Fan and Ye Yingjian?

35:06.560 --> 35:08.160
Cao Fan went to Shenzhen to start her own business.

35:08.160 --> 35:09.360
I heard she's doing quite well.

35:09.880 --> 35:11.920
Ye Yingjian went abroad.

35:12.840 --> 35:14.760
And that, that...

35:14.880 --> 35:15.440
Shu Han.

35:16.040 --> 35:17.440
Shu Han went with him.

35:19.440 --> 35:20.040
Cousin,

35:21.120 --> 35:22.240
aren't you curious

35:22.240 --> 35:23.200
about what I'm up to?

35:23.880 --> 35:24.520
You?

35:25.240 --> 35:26.160
You

35:26.600 --> 35:28.360
started as a truck driver,

35:28.680 --> 35:29.360
then slowly

35:29.360 --> 35:30.440
built your own fleet

35:30.440 --> 35:31.240
and became the boss.

35:31.680 --> 35:32.240
Not long ago,

35:32.240 --> 35:33.240
you got a new batch of trucks.

35:33.520 --> 35:34.520
How did you know?

35:34.680 --> 35:36.360
You post millions of Moments a day.

35:36.520 --> 35:37.840
Hard not to know.

35:40.720 --> 35:42.560
You're a big boss now!

35:44.440 --> 35:45.520
I've been out in the world

35:45.520 --> 35:46.560
four years longer than you.

35:47.240 --> 35:48.880
But compared to Wu,

35:48.880 --> 35:50.040
I'm still a nobody.

35:50.440 --> 35:51.000
Wu

35:51.240 --> 35:52.640
is still the most successful man

35:52.640 --> 35:53.760
in Zhazhating.

35:54.280 --> 35:54.840
Qing Ye,

35:55.160 --> 35:56.360
has Xing Wu come back?

35:56.560 --> 35:57.400
Has he contacted you?

35:58.320 --> 35:58.760
Right,

35:59.320 --> 36:00.160
why isn't he here yet?

36:09.360 --> 36:10.080
Now,

36:10.520 --> 36:12.680
please crank your applause up

36:13.000 --> 36:14.680
to deafening mode.

36:15.000 --> 36:15.760
Let's greet today's

36:15.960 --> 36:17.560
leading couple with overwhelming

36:18.000 --> 36:20.320
enthusiasm as they make their

36:20.640 --> 36:21.600
center-stage debut.

36:21.840 --> 36:23.040
Let's warmly welcome

36:23.240 --> 36:25.880
our most dazzling bride and groom.

36:26.080 --> 36:27.520
Shine on, make your entrance!

36:27.800 --> 36:29.840
Yeah!

36:30.000 --> 36:30.800
Yeah!

36:31.120 --> 36:32.600
Yeah!

37:42.720 --> 37:44.640
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

37:44.640 --> 37:45.520
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

37:45.600 --> 37:49.280
Kiss, kiss, kiss!

37:50.280 --> 37:51.200
Where did you kiss?

37:51.760 --> 37:52.680
On the lips!

37:52.680 --> 37:53.720
On the lips!

38:00.880 --> 38:02.640
Congratulations to the newlyweds.

38:02.960 --> 38:04.720
The ceremony is complete!

38:14.440 --> 38:14.920
The microphone.

38:14.960 --> 38:15.960
Congratulations.

38:17.880 --> 38:19.520
I have something to say.

38:20.080 --> 38:20.960
Today

38:20.960 --> 38:21.680
is a very

38:21.680 --> 38:22.760
special day for me,

38:23.080 --> 38:24.880
and now is the perfect time to say it.

38:25.640 --> 38:27.320
I want to thank someone

38:27.320 --> 38:29.160
very important to me.

38:29.560 --> 38:30.800
Because of you,

38:31.520 --> 38:34.160
I went from being insecure

38:34.320 --> 38:35.120
to becoming brave.

38:35.840 --> 38:37.320
You taught me to express

38:37.320 --> 38:38.560
what's in my heart

38:39.520 --> 38:41.680
and to know

38:41.680 --> 38:42.680
my true self.

38:44.000 --> 38:44.600
So,

38:46.400 --> 38:47.120
Qing Ye,

38:52.320 --> 38:53.400
I want to give it you.

38:53.880 --> 38:54.800
In my senior year,

38:55.040 --> 38:55.920
you changed

38:55.920 --> 38:56.800
my life.

38:57.040 --> 38:58.280
You gave me happiness

38:59.280 --> 39:00.880
and led me to the joy I have now.

39:01.760 --> 39:03.560
Thank you, truly.

39:04.520 --> 39:06.200
I hope your future will be

39:06.520 --> 39:07.640
as bright as these flowers.

39:08.440 --> 39:08.960
No,

39:09.600 --> 39:10.440
even

39:10.440 --> 39:11.080
brighter!

39:18.000 --> 39:18.600
Thank you.

39:21.400 --> 39:24.000
Great!

39:26.320 --> 39:27.880
You will be happy, Qing Ye.

39:34.760 --> 39:36.800
Here! Cheers!

39:36.880 --> 39:37.560
Thanks.

39:38.000 --> 39:38.800
Thank you.

39:39.720 --> 39:40.680
Congratulations.

39:41.240 --> 39:41.880
Congratulations.

39:41.960 --> 39:42.840
Thank you.

39:43.640 --> 39:45.000
Let's drink till we drop.

39:47.360 --> 39:48.040
Qing Ye,

39:49.000 --> 39:49.960
what are you doing here?

39:50.080 --> 39:50.960
Come and sit with them.

39:51.840 --> 39:52.320
I,

39:53.520 --> 39:54.560
I'm really craving

39:54.760 --> 39:56.080
those little cakes from Zhazhating.

39:56.760 --> 39:57.280
Qing Ye.

39:57.960 --> 39:59.320
Neither of us has our phone.

39:59.360 --> 40:00.200
Can we borrow yours

40:00.240 --> 40:01.040
to call Wu?

40:05.960 --> 40:06.400
Okay.

40:06.640 --> 40:07.120
Here.

40:17.920 --> 40:18.520
Sorry,

40:18.520 --> 40:19.280
I need to take this.

40:19.360 --> 40:19.760
Okay.

40:20.640 --> 40:21.400
Yes, ma'am?

40:22.560 --> 40:24.320
[The client is about to blow up.]

40:24.560 --> 40:25.720
[You're the one at the helm.]

40:25.880 --> 40:26.960
[What if the ship goes off course?]

40:27.200 --> 40:27.960
Sorry, ma'am.

40:27.960 --> 40:28.960
I'm still out of town.

40:29.080 --> 40:30.280
You're the project lead.

40:30.400 --> 40:31.400
The client scheduled a meeting

40:31.400 --> 40:32.200
for 9 a.m. tomorrow.

40:32.840 --> 40:33.400
You must be

40:33.400 --> 40:34.320
back in Beijing tonight.

40:52.800 --> 40:53.240
He didn't answer.

40:53.640 --> 40:54.840
Probably still on the plane.

40:55.320 --> 40:56.000
Let's wait.

40:56.040 --> 40:57.000
He said he'd come.

40:59.360 --> 40:59.720
Well,

40:59.800 --> 41:01.320
Shi Min, Big G, Kyle.

41:01.320 --> 41:02.000
I'm so sorry.

41:02.520 --> 41:03.320
My boss says I have to

41:03.360 --> 41:04.400
be in Beijing today

41:04.400 --> 41:05.320
for a meeting tomorrow morning.

41:05.520 --> 41:06.560
I probably need to

41:06.560 --> 41:07.440
catch a flight now.

41:07.440 --> 41:08.520
Please tell Auntie

41:08.520 --> 41:09.080
for me.

41:09.360 --> 41:10.400
I won't go over and disturb them.

41:11.240 --> 41:11.960
Got it.

41:12.640 --> 41:14.280
We'll keep in touch on WeChat.

41:14.760 --> 41:15.440
See you next time.

41:16.080 --> 41:16.640
Give me a hug.

41:17.920 --> 41:18.760
Happy wedding,

41:18.960 --> 41:19.520
take care.

41:19.960 --> 41:20.800
Take care on the road.

41:22.240 --> 41:22.960
I'm off then.

41:23.520 --> 41:23.840
So,

41:24.040 --> 41:24.800
you're not waiting?

41:26.240 --> 41:26.840
Alright, go ahead.

41:26.840 --> 41:27.520
Go ahead.

41:27.520 --> 41:28.200
Safe trip.

41:32.320 --> 41:33.160
This Xing Wu...

42:12.880 --> 42:14.760
Sir, please go faster.

42:14.840 --> 42:15.360
Okay.
